  "note": "Reviewed 2026-10-24/27 for J5's advance from 70d60e03a7 to upstream stable v0.1.3. Migrations 063-069 are appended above the high-water mark (063 drops six V1 projection tables J5 never reads; 069 adds the message full-text index). Migrations 027, 031, 037, 044, 046, 053, 056, 058 and 060, and two of 055's OrchestrationV2 helper files, changed comments only (upstream's comment pruning, pingdotgg/t3code#21514); their SQL is identical. Migration 050 now imports a frozen copy of its pull-request key helper (Migrations/legacyThreadPullRequestKey.ts, #23992) instead of @t3tools/shared, so the live source-control refactor cannot change what it computes; a recorded 050 never reruns, and only a fresh database executes the frozen copy. No migration was renumbered or removed.",
